    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Pillmore, Youghal, Co. Cork, P36 YC99\r\n\r\nDNG Spillane are delighted to present this three-bedroom detached bungalow to the market, ideally positioned in the popular coastal area of Pillmore, just outside Youghal. Set on a substantial site extending to approximately 0.79 acres and located close to Pilmore Beach, the property offers an excellent opportunity to acquire a detached home in a peaceful countryside setting while remaining within easy reach of Youghal town.\r\n\r\nExtending to approximately 1,050 sq. ft. (98 sq. m.), the property is presented in standard condition throughout and offers practical single-level accommodation with plenty of scope for a new owner to modernise or enhance the house over time to suit their own requirements.\r\n\r\nInternally, the accommodation comprises a living room, kitchen/dining area, three bedrooms and a family bathroom. The straightforward layout makes good use of the available space and provides all of the accommodation expected of a traditional three-bedroom bungalow.\r\n\r\nExternally, the property is set on an impressive site of approximately 0.79 acres, providing excellent space around the residence together with ample private off-street parking. The size of the grounds is a particularly attractive feature of the property and offers considerable scope for landscaping, gardening or further enhancement.\r\n\r\nThe substantial site may also offer potential for the construction of an additional dwelling, subject to obtaining the necessary planning permission and satisfying all relevant planning requirements. This provides an interesting additional dimension to the property for purchasers considering its longer-term potential.\r\n\r\nThe location is a major attraction. Pilmore Beach is close by, providing convenient access to one of the area's popular stretches of coastline, while Youghal town is within easy reach and offers a wide selection of shops, supermarkets, schools, restaurants, cafés, sporting facilities and everyday services. The surrounding area also provides convenient access to a number of beaches and coastal amenities along the East Cork coastline.\r\n\r\nThe property benefits from oil-fired central heating, a D2 BER rating, private well and septic tank.\r\n\r\nFor purchasers seeking a detached property with a large site close to the coast, Pillmore represents an interesting opportunity. The combination of its 0.79-acre setting, proximity to Pilmore Beach and potential for further improvement or development, subject to planning permission, should appeal to a broad range of buyers.\r\n\r\nViewing is strictly by appointment with sole selling agents DNG Spillane."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Three-bedroom detached bungalow\r\n\r\nApproximately 1,050 sq. ft. / 98 sq. m.\r\n\r\nSubstantial site extending to approximately 0.79 acres\r\n\r\nExcellent coastal location close to Pilmore Beach\r\n\r\nScope to modernise and enhance\r\n\r\nPotential for an additional dwelling, subject to planning permission\r\n\r\nOil-fired central heating\r\n\r\nD2 BER rating\r\n\r\nPrivate well and septic tank\r\n\r\nAmple private off-street parking\r\n\r\nWithin easy reach of Youghal town and local amenities"
